                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Ke:mah, witsyoh neli, we:lik we:lik n' iteyo, no: se: kitewa:tsa, *porque** a:mo weli porin witsyoh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
